          %h2#constructions_of_weight_systems Constructions of weight systems
          %h3#LieAlgebraWeightSystems Lie algebra weight systems
          %p
            A large class of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/weight+systems"} weight systems
            arises from reading a (
