            %a{:href => "#BarNatan95"}> Bar-Natan 95, Conjecture 1
            ,
            = succeed ")." do
              %a{:href => "Lie+algebra+weight+system#BarNatanStoimenow97"} Bar-Natan &amp; Stoimenow 97, Conjecture 2.4
          %p
