            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+algebra+weight+systems"} Lie algebra weight systems
          %p
            From the construction given in
            %a{:href => "#BarNatan95"} Bar-Natan 95, Section 2.4
            the interpretation of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+algebra+weight+systems"} Lie algebra weight systems
            in terms of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+diagrams"} string diagrams
            for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+algebra+objects"} Lie algebra objects
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tensor+categories"} tensor categories
            is evident, but standard textbooks in
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/knot+theory"} knot theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/combinatorics"} combinatorics
            do not pick this up:
          %ul
            %li#ChmutovDuzhinMostovoy11
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergei+Chmutov"}> Sergei Chmutov
                ,
